    schemeCitation: "Marking points quoted from the SEC marking scheme, Economics 2022 Ordinary Level — © State Examinations Commission.",
    id: "econ-2022-ol-sa-q3-i", topicId: "economics-1-1", conceptId: "online-shopping-cause-and-retailer-disadvantage",
    section: "A", questionRef: "2022 OL Section A Q3",
    stem: "During 2020 and 2021 more Irish consumers shopped online.",
    questionText: "Outline one possible reason for this development. Outline one possible disadvantage of this development for local retailers.",
    tariffModel: {"kind":"questionTotal","notation":"15","answer":null,"ofParts":null,"perPart":null}, totalMarks: 15,
    rows: [
    { id: "r-reason", kind: "point", verbatim: "Lockdowns due to Covid-19: resulted in the temporary closure of retail outlets and so consumers had no alternative.\n\nOnline shopping became more accessible: more firms moved online in an effort to increase sales / stay in business.\n\nFears about health and safety: some consumers fearful for their health switched their buying to online shopping to reduce the risk.\n\nMore competitive prices: foreign retailers may have been able to offer more competitive prices due to economies of scale.\n\nConvenience: consumers want greater choice; more competitive price and ease of return without additional cost.", marks: null, contextNote: "One reason more consumers shopped online. Complete BOTH parts. The scheme prices (i) and (ii) together as one 15: the first correct answer 9 marks (6 + 3) and the second 6 (3 + 3), with no fixed share for either part.", openList: true },
    { id: "r-disadvantage", kind: "point", verbatim: "Reduced sales / profits: if consumers shop online then local retailers will lose sales / revenue due to lack of footfall / reduction in impulse buying.\n\nDecline in domestic economic activity: due to the possible reduction in people shopping in the locality.\n\nJob losses: retailers may reduce number of employees due to reduced store sales.", marks: null, contextNote: "One disadvantage for local retailers. A disadvantage for local shops.", openList: true },
    ],
