          "alt": "The marking scheme's completed monopoly diagram. The vertical axis is labelled P/C and the horizontal Q. A U-shaped average cost curve labelled AC, a rising marginal cost curve labelled MC, a thick downward-sloping average revenue curve labelled AR and a steeper downward-sloping marginal revenue curve labelled MR. Point G is where MC cuts MR; a vertical line drops from G to the quantity axis at Q1. Where that line meets AR a dot is taken across to the price axis at P1, and where it meets AC a second dot is taken across to C1, which sits below P1.",
