    section: "B", questionRef: "2025 OL Q15(b)(ii)",
    stem: "It is forecasted that Ireland’s population will grow to 5.9 million by 2030. The diagram below shows the market demand curve and market supply curve for housing in Ireland. The forecasted increase in population is expected to affect the demand for housing. Show the effect of this development on the diagram above.",
    questionText: "Explain your answer.",
